---
import HelloFraandsPage from '../layouts/HelloFraandsPage.astro';
import MaskedCallSteps from '../components/callvaal/MaskedCallSteps.astro';
export const prerender = true;
---
<HelloFraandsPage title="How it works" summary="Teen aasaan kadam, bina apna number share kiye.">
<h2>Your number stays yours</h2><p>Neither person sees the other's personal phone number. Here is how the masked call connects.</p>
<MaskedCallSteps />
<h2>Top up with UPI</h2><p>Sign in, open your wallet, choose a top-up amount and pay with UPI. Check the total and any shown tax before paying. Once the payment succeeds, the available talk-time balance appears in your wallet.</p>
<h2>Pay by the minute</h2><p>Check the host's per-minute rate before calling. Your wallet pays for the time you talk. A low-balance warning tells you when about 1 minute remains at that rate. The call ends when the wallet is empty.</p>
<h2>Want to keep talking?</h2><p>Open your wallet again, add funds through UPI and wait for confirmation. Then start a new call with an available host. See <a href="/wallet-terms">wallet terms</a> and <a href="/refunds">refunds</a> for billing details.</p>
<p>The current site is a preview with illustrative profiles. Calls and payments are unavailable in the preview.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
